{"seq":3,"slug":"developer-experience-metrics","title":"开发者体验度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-foundations/developer-experience-metrics","wordCount":962,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"开发者体验度量\">开发者体验度量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>开发者体验（Developer Experience，DevEx）度量是平台工程的关键反馈机制。没有有效的度量体系，平台团队就无法判断平台是否真正提升了开发效率，也无法量化投资回报。DevEx 度量关注的不仅是技术指标，更包括开发者的主观感受和工作流顺畅度。</p>\n<p>度量框架的选择决定了团队的优化方向。目前业界主流的度量框架包括 DORA 指标（面向交付效能）、SPACE 框架（面向开发者生产力）以及 DevEx 三维度模型（面向开发者体验）。这三者互补而非互斥。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[平台效能度量] --&gt; B[DORA 指标]&#10;    A --&gt; C[SPACE 框架]&#10;    A --&gt; D[DevEx 三维度]&#10;    B --&gt; E[交付速度与稳定性]&#10;    C --&gt; F[多维生产力视角]&#10;    D --&gt; G[开发者主观体验]&#10;    E --&gt; H[平台优化决策]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[平台效能度量] --&gt; B[DORA 指标]\n    A --&gt; C[SPACE 框架]\n    A --&gt; D[DevEx 三维度]\n    B --&gt; E[交付速度与稳定性]\n    C --&gt; F[多维生产力视角]\n    D --&gt; G[开发者主观体验]\n    E --&gt; H[平台优化决策]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>核心指标数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DORA</td>\n<td>交付效能</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>CI/CD 效能评估</td>\n<td>自动采集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPACE</td>\n<td>多维生产力</td>\n<td>5 维度</td>\n<td>全面生产力评估</td>\n<td>混合采集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DevEx</td>\n<td>开发者体验</td>\n<td>3 维度</td>\n<td>平台用户满意度</td>\n<td>调查问卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>平台特定</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n<td>特定能力评估</td>\n<td>混合采集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"dora-四大关键指标\">DORA 四大关键指标</h2><p>DORA（DevOps Research and Assessment）团队经过多年研究，提炼出四个核心指标来衡量软件交付效能。这些指标已被广泛验证，是评估平台工程效果的基础度量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DORAMetrics {&#10;  deploymentFrequency: {&#10;    definition: &#39;单位时间内成功部署到生产环境的次数&#39;;&#10;    elite: &#39;每天多次&#39;;&#10;    high: &#39;每天一次到每周一次&#39;;&#10;    medium: &#39;每周一次到每月一次&#39;;&#10;    low: &#39;每月一次到每半年一次&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  leadTimeForChanges: {&#10;    definition: &#39;从代码提交到生产运行的时间&#39;;&#10;    elite: &#39;小于 1 小时&#39;;&#10;    high: &#39;1 天到 1 周&#39;;&#10;    medium: &#39;1 周到 1 个月&#39;;&#10;    low: &#39;1 个月到 6 个月&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  changeFailureRate: {&#10;    definition: &#39;导致服务降级或需要回滚的部署比例&#39;;&#10;    elite: &#39;0-15%&#39;;&#10;    high: &#39;16-30%&#39;;&#10;    medium: &#39;16-30%&#39;;&#10;    low: &#39;16-30%&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  timeToRestoreService: {&#10;    definition: &#39;服务故障后恢复正常的平均时间&#39;;&#10;    elite: &#39;小于 1 小时&#39;;&#10;    high: &#39;小于 1 天&#39;;&#10;    medium: &#39;1 天到 1 周&#39;;&#10;    low: &#39;超过 6 个月&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DORAMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deploymentFrequency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    definition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '单位时间内成功部署到生产环境的次数'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    elite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '每天多次'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    high</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '每天一次到每周一次'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    medium</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '每周一次到每月一次'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    low</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '每月一次到每半年一次'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  leadTimeForChanges</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    definition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '从代码提交到生产运行的时间'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    elite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '小于 1 小时'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    high</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1 天到 1 周'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    medium</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1 周到 1 个月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    low</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1 个月到 6 个月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  changeFailureRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    definition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '导致服务降级或需要回滚的部署比例'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    elite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0-15%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    high</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '16-30%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    medium</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '16-30%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    low</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '16-30%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timeToRestoreService</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    definition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '服务故障后恢复正常的平均时间'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    elite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '小于 1 小时'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    high</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '小于 1 天'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    medium</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1 天到 1 周'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    low</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '超过 6 个月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在平台工程上下文中，DORA 指标的采集应该自动化。通过 CI/CD 流水线事件、Git 提交记录和监控告警数据，可以实现完全自动化的 DORA 指标计算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"dora_data_sources:&#10;  deployment_frequency:&#10;    source: &#39;CI/CD 流水线完成事件&#39;&#10;    collection: &#39;ArgoCD webhook → 指标聚合服务&#39;&#10;    granularity: &#39;按团队、按服务&#39;&#10;&#10;  lead_time:&#10;    source: &#39;Git commit timestamp → 部署完成 timestamp&#39;&#10;    collection: &#39;Git webhook + 部署事件关联&#39;&#10;    granularity: &#39;按 PR、按服务&#39;&#10;&#10;  change_failure_rate:&#10;    source: &#39;回滚事件 / 总部署事件&#39;&#10;    collection: &#39;ArgoCD 回滚记录 + 事件告警&#39;&#10;    granularity: &#39;按服务、按环境&#39;&#10;&#10;  time_to_restore:&#10;    source: &#39;告警触发时间 → 恢复确认时间&#39;&#10;    collection: &#39;PagerDuty/Alertmanager 事件&#39;&#10;    granularity: &#39;按服务、按严重级别&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dora_data_sources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  deployment_frequency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CI/CD 流水线完成事件'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    collection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ArgoCD webhook → 指标聚合服务'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    granularity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'按团队、按服务'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lead_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Git commit timestamp → 部署完成 timestamp'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    collection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Git webhook + 部署事件关联'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    granularity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'按 PR、按服务'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  change_failure_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'回滚事件 / 总部署事件'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    collection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ArgoCD 回滚记录 + 事件告警'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    granularity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'按服务、按环境'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  time_to_restore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'告警触发时间 → 恢复确认时间'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    collection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PagerDuty/Alertmanager 事件'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    granularity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'按服务、按严重级别'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DORA 指标的局限性在于它主要反映交付管道的效能，而非开发者的全面体验。一个团队可能有出色的 DORA 指标，但开发者依然感到痛苦——因为交付效率高不等于工作体验好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"space-生产力框架\">SPACE 生产力框架</h2><p>SPACE 框架由 GitHub、微软和维多利亚大学联合提出，将开发者生产力分解为五个维度，避免了用单一指标衡量复杂工作的陷阱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph SPACE 框架&#10;        S[Satisfaction&lt;br&gt;满意度与幸福感]&#10;        P[Performance&lt;br&gt;工作产出]&#10;        A[Activity&lt;br&gt;活动量]&#10;        C[Communication&lt;br&gt;协作与沟通]&#10;        E[Efficiency&lt;br&gt;流程效率]&#10;    end&#10;    S --- P&#10;    P --- A&#10;    A --- C&#10;    C --- E\">graph LR\n    subgraph SPACE 框架\n        S[Satisfaction&lt;br&gt;满意度与幸福感]\n        P[Performance&lt;br&gt;工作产出]\n        A[Activity&lt;br&gt;活动量]\n        C[Communication&lt;br&gt;协作与沟通]\n        E[Efficiency&lt;br&gt;流程效率]\n    end\n    S --- P\n    P --- A\n    A --- C\n    C --- E</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SPACEDimensions {&#10;  satisfaction: {&#10;    what: &#39;开发者对工作和工具的满意度&#39;;&#10;    metrics: [&#39;开发者满意度调查（1-5分）&#39;, &#39;工具满意度评分&#39;, &#39;推荐意愿（eNPS）&#39;];&#10;    collection: &#39;季度调查问卷&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  performance: {&#10;    what: &#39;工作产出的质量与影响&#39;;&#10;    metrics: [&#39;代码审查通过率&#39;, &#39;用户故事完成率&#39;, &#39;缺陷逃逸率&#39;];&#10;    collection: &#39;自动采集 + Sprint 回顾&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  activity: {&#10;    what: &#39;可量化的开发活动&#39;;&#10;    metrics: [&#39;PR 数量&#39;, &#39;部署次数&#39;, &#39;代码审查参与度&#39;];&#10;    collection: &#39;Git/CI 平台自动采集&#39;;&#10;    warning: &#39;不应单独用于评估个人绩效&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  communication: {&#10;    what: &#39;团队协作和知识分享的质量&#39;;&#10;    metrics: [&#39;PR 审查响应时间&#39;, &#39;文档更新频率&#39;, &#39;跨团队协作频次&#39;];&#10;    collection: &#39;工具 API + 调查&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  efficiency: {&#10;    what: &#39;完成工作的流畅度&#39;;&#10;    metrics: [&#39;构建等待时间&#39;, &#39;环境就绪时间&#39;, &#39;CI 反馈时间&#39;];&#10;    collection: &#39;CI/CD 平台自动采集&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SPACEDimensions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  satisfaction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    what</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '开发者对工作和工具的满意度'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'开发者满意度调查（1-5分）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'工具满意度评分'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'推荐意愿（eNPS）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    collection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '季度调查问卷'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  performance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    what</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '工作产出的质量与影响'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'代码审查通过率'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'用户故事完成率'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'缺陷逃逸率'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">   